  "body": "Brand New | Internal Access Garage | Freehold | 10-Year Halo Guarantee\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendor – All Reasonable Offers Considered!\r\n\r\nSpace for your family. Sea views to enjoy. Excellent schools for your children.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this beautifully designed, brand-new three-bedroom home at 124 Arran Road, Browns Bay, offering an impressive 137sqm of modern living in a highly sought-after North Shore location.\r\n\r\nWith generous proportions, a thoughtfully designed layout and contemporary finishes, this home delivers the space and comfort your family deserves.\r\n\r\nWhy Your Family Will Love This Home:\r\n\r\n• Impressive 137sqm Floor Area – Generous living spaces designed for comfort, relaxation and entertaining.\r\n• Three Spacious Bedrooms – Ideal for growing families or those needing extra room.\r\n• Beautiful Sea Views – Enjoy refreshing coastal outlooks and a wonderful sense of openness.\r\n• Internal Access Garage – Secure and convenient parking with direct access to your home.\r\n• Highly Sought-After School Zones – Including Rangitoto College, Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n• Freehold Title & No Body Corporate Fees – Enjoy independent ownership without ongoing body corporate fees.\r\n• 10-Year Halo Guarantee – Added confidence and peace of mind.\r\n• Brand-New & Low Maintenance – Stylish interiors, modern appliances and easy-care living.\r\n• Prime Browns Bay Location – Close to beaches, cafés, supermarkets, shopping and everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nAlso an Attractive Investment Opportunity!\r\n\r\nWith a rental appraisal of $820–$860 per week, this property offers potential annual gross rental income of approximately $42,640–$44,720.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your next family home or a quality investment, this property combines spacious living, excellent schooling options and attractive rental potential.\r\n\r\nMore Space. More Comfort. More Reasons to Call It Home.\r\n\r\nThe Vendor Is Motivated and Ready to Meet the Market!\r\n\r\nAll reasonable offers will be seriously considered.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to secure a spacious, brand-new family home with sea views in this fantastic North Shore location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing!\r\n\r\nRental figures are appraisals only. Actual rental income may vary.",
